===
### name: lex.text.single-quote-doubles
--- dialect
mariadb
--- source
"it's"
--- expect
'it''s'
===
### name: lex.text.backslash-doubles-on-mysql-family
--- note
MariaDB treats \ as an escape inside a string literal under the default
sql_mode. PostgreSQL and SQLite do not, and their maps omit the rule.
--- dialect
mariadb
--- source
'a\b'
--- expect
'a\\b'
===
